          "color": "#8c6d1f",
          "translit": "koinoō",
          "gloss": "defile; literally, make common, treat as ordinary",
          "echo": "Acts 10:14–15, 28 and 11:8–9 (what God has cleansed, do not call common); Rom 14:14; Mark 7:15 has the same saying."
        },
