          "translit": "Chananaia",
          "gloss": "a woman of Canaan, a Canaanite woman",
          "echo": "Gen 10:15, 19 (Sidon, firstborn of Canaan; the Canaanites' border runs from Sidon); Deut 7:1 (Canaan's nations to be driven out); Matt 1:3, 5 (Canaanite women already in the Anointed's line). The word occurs nowhere else in the New Testament."
